  "Curtain Call": "",
  "Incision Technique/Sinful Game Lv.$1": "",
  "Incision Technique/Sinful Game <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "<link=\"s|198\"><u>[Hunter]</u></link>: Deal Phys damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK ($1 hits), then inflict $3 <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> stack.\\n<link=\"s|199\"><u>[Executioner]</u></link>: Deal Phys damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> of ATK, remove $4 <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> stacks after this skill (can activate <link=\"s|197\"><u>[Laceration]</u></link> effects).\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>A cold light appears, and the sharp blade descends swiftly and accurately like a blade of judgement, silently bringing the aftertaste of death and inflicting horrific damage to the foe.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Lethal Pleasure/\\nCurtain Call Lv.$1": "",
  "Lethal Pleasure/\\nCurtain Call <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "<link=\"s|198\"><u>[Hunter]</u></link>: Deal Phys damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK ($1 hits). Immediately deal <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> damage and refresh <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> duration.\\n<link=\"s|199\"><u>[Executioner]</u></link>: Deal Phys damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> of ATK, for every 1 <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> stack on the target, increase <link=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> and <link=\"s|197\"><u>[Laceration]</u></link> damage by $4. Remove all <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> stacks after this skill (can activate <link=\"s|197\"><u>[Laceration]</u></link> effects).\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Sharp trails like blossoming flowers in a mist of blood, bringing a cold and merciless killing intent, tearing apart the foe's remaining vitality and inflicting irreversible damage.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Night's Arrival Lv.$1": "",
  "Night's Arrival <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Unlock when any foe has ≥7 <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> stacks.\\nTransform into <link=\"s|199\"><u>[Executioner]</u></link>, change skills and gain the effect: When using skills, for every $1 <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> stacks, deal 1 bonus [Laceration] hit: Phys damage equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK.\\nKitazato can still use other skills after using this skill, automatically transform back into <link=\"s|198\"><u>[Hunter]</u></link> at the end of turn.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>The sharp blades are intertwined, and the twin blades are skillfully united, with cold light bursting out from where the blades meet, and the blade's momentum changes in an instant, which is within your grasp.</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Transform into <link=\"s|198\"><u>[Hunter]</u></link>, immediately inflict $1 <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> stacks on 1 foe; Then, immediately transform into <link=\"s|199\"><u>[Executioner]</u></link>, deal Phys damage equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK (can activate <link=\"s|197\"><u>[Laceration]</u></link> effects).\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Deal Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
  "For every $1 Ailment ACC, increase the Phys damage from <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> based on $2 ATK, up to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> Ailment ACC.": "",
  "For every $1 Ailment ACC, increase the Phys damage from <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> based on $2 ATK, up to <color=#0169ca>$3</color> Ailment ACC.": "",
  "When in <link=\"s|198\"><u>[Hunter]</u></link>, increase Ailment ACC by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color>.\\nWhen in <link=\"s|199\"><u>[Executioner]</u></link>, increase Pierce by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color>.": "",
  "When in <link=\"s|198\"><u>[Hunter]</u></link>, increase Ailment ACC by <color=#0169ca>$1</color>.\\nWhen in <link=\"s|199\"><u>[Executioner]</u></link>, increase Pierce by <color=#0169ca>$2</color>.": "",
  "At the end of foe's turn, for every <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> stack, permanently decrease Max HP by $1, up to $2.\\nWhen in <link=\"s|198\"><u>[Hunter]</u></link>, increase ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color>.\\nWhen in <link=\"s|199\"><u>[Executioner]</u></link>, increase Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$4</color>.": "",
  "At the end of foe's turn, for every <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> stack, permanently decrease Max HP by $1, up to $2.\\nWhen in <link=\"s|198\"><u>[Hunter]</u></link>, increase ATK by <color=#0169ca>$3</color>.\\nWhen in <link=\"s|199\"><u>[Executioner]</u></link>, increase Crit DMG by <color=#0169ca>$4</color>.": "",
  "Increase <link=\"s|197\"><u>[Laceration]</u></link> and [Execution] Skill Damage by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> + Kitazato's Awareness level * $2.\\nAfter using [Night's Arrival], increase all allies' DOT Effect by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> + Kitazato's Awareness level * $4. Lasts for $5 turns. \\nWhen Phys allies deal damage, if foes have $6 or more [Bleed] stacks, increase Total DMG Amp by <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> + Kitazato's Awareness level * $8 and damage by <color=#FFFC40>$9</color> + Kitazato's Awareness level * $10.": "",
  "Increase <link=\"s|197\"><u>[Laceration]</u></link> and [Execution] Skill Damage by <color=#0169ca>$1</color> + Kitazato's Awareness level * $2.\\nAfter using [Night's Arrival], increase all allies' DOT Effect by <color=#0169ca>$3</color> + Kitazato's Awareness level * $4. Lasts for $5 turns. \\nWhen Phys allies deal damage, if foes have $6 or more [Bleed] stacks, increase Total DMG Amp by <color=#0169ca>$7</color> + Kitazato's Awareness level * $8 and damage by <color=#0169ca>$9</color> + Kitazato's Awareness level * $10.": "",
  "<color=#66ccff>[Hunter]</color>": "",
  "Hunter": "",
  "{{A}}'s initial state, can inflict, deal, and refresh [Bleed]. [Bleed]: Take Almighty damage based on the target's Max HP (up to $1 of {{A}}'s ATK) and Phys damage based on {{A}}'s ATK each turn.": "",
  "<color=#66ccff>[Executioner]</color>": "",
  "Executioner": "",
  "Transform to [Executioner] after using [Night's Arrival], changing skills, can remove [Bleed] to deal [Laceration] damage. [Laceration]: Deal damage based on [Bleed] stacks.": "",
  "<color=#66ccff>[Bleed]</color>": "",
  "Bleed": "",
  "{{A}} can inflict this when he is in [Hunter]. Take Almighty damage based on the target's Max HP (up to $1 of {{A}}'s ATK) and Phys damage based on {{A}}'s ATK each turn.": "",
  "<color=#66ccff>[Laceration]</color>": "",
  "Laceration": "",
  "When using skills in [Executioner], for every $1 stacks of [Bleed], deal 1 additional hit of [Laceration] damage.": "",
  "Reaper's Victory": "",
  "{{A}} has [Hunter] and [Executioner] state, and the properties of his skills change depending on the state, start in [Hunter].\\n[Hunter]: Each time {{A}} deals damage with a skill, $1 base chance to inflict 1 [Bleed] stack on the target. When a foe with [Bleed] is defeated, its [Bleed] stacks are passed on to the foe with the highest HP.\\n[Executioner]: When {{A}} uses a skill, deal [Laceration] damage once for every $2 [Bleed] stacks on the target.\\n[Bleed]: Take Almighty damage equal to $3 of the target's Max HP (up to $4 of {{A}}'s ATK) + Phys damage equal to $5 of {{A}}'s ATK. This effect lasts for $6 turns and stacks up to $7 times.\\n[Laceration]: Deal Phys damage based on {{A}}'s ATK and [Night's Arrival]'s skill level, this damage cannot deal Down Point damage. {{A}}'s {{B}} skill damage and HIGHLIGHT damage counts as Damage Over Time.": "",
  "Ring Around the Rosie": "",
  "In <link=\"s|198\"><u>[Hunter]</u></link>, additionally inflict $1 stacks of <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> when dealing skill damage to each foe for the first time.\\nIn <link=\"s|199\"><u>[Executioner]</u></link>, increase skill damage based on foes' debuffs, up to $3 more skill damage at $2 stacks of debuffs.\\nAlso, increase <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link>'s Almighty damage to $3 of the original damage.": "",
  "A Pocket Full of Posies": "",
  "Accompanied by Flowers": "",
  "Increase <link=\"s|197\"><u>[Laceration]</u></link> skill multiplier by $1 ATK. Restore HP equal to $2 <link=\"s|197\"><u>[Laceration]</u></link> damage (Up to level * $3 + $4 HP each turn)": "",
  "Jumping off the Ground": "",
  "Ashes, Ashes": "",
  "HIGHLIGHT Enhanced: For every 1 stack of <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> on the target, increase HIGHLIGHT damage by $1.": "",
  "We All Fall Down": "",
  "Increase <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> cap to $1 stacks, all foes will never drop below $2 stacks of <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link>.\\nIn <link=\"s|199\"><u>[Executioner]</u></link>, [Sinful Game] no longer remove <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link>; <link=\"s|197\"><u>[Laceration]</u></link> is upgraded to [Execution], increase [Execution] damage by $3 and deal $4 damage as splash damage to all foes. [Execution] can trigger all effects of <link=\"s|197\"><u>[Laceration]</u></link>.": "",
  "Deal Phys damage to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $2 of ATK ($1 hits), then inflict $3 [Bleed] stack.": "",
  "<link=\"s|198\"><u>[Hunter]</u></link>: Deal Phys damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK ($1 hits). Then inflict $3 <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> stack.": "",
  "Deal Phys damage to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $2 of ATK ($1 hits). Immediately deal [Bleed] damage and refresh [Bleed] duration.": "",
  "<link=\"s|198\"><u>[Hunter]</u></link>: Deal Phys damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK ($1 hits). Immediately deal <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> damage and refresh <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> duration.": "",
  "Unlock when any foe has ≥7 [Bleed] stacks. Transform into [Executioner], change skills and gain the effect: When using skills, for every $1 [Bleed] stacks, deal 1 bonus [Laceration] hit: $2 ATK Phys damage.": "",
  "Unlock when any foe has ≥7 <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> stacks.\\nTransform into <link=\"s|199\"><u>[Executioner]</u></link>, change skills and gain this effect: When using skills, for every $1 <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> stacks, deal 1 bonus [Laceration] hit: <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> ATK Phys damage. \\nKitazato can still use other skills after using this skill, automatically transform back into <link=\"s|198\"><u>[Hunter]</u></link> at the end of turn.": "",
  "Deal Phys damage to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $1 of ATK, remove $2 [Bleed] stacks after this skill (can activate [Laceration] effects).": "",
  "<link=\"s|199\"><u>[Executioner]</u></link>: Deal Phys damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK , remove $2 <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> stacks after this skill (can activate <link=\"s|197\"><u>[Laceration]</u></link> effects).": "",
  "Deal Phys damage to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $1 of ATK, for every 1 [Bleed] stack on the target, increase Skill Damage by $2. Remove all [Bleed] stacks after this skill (can activate [Laceration] effects).": "",
  "<link=\"s|199\"><u>[Executioner]</u></link>: Deal Phys damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, for every 1 <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> stack on the target, increase <link=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> and <link=\"s|197\"><u>[Laceration]</u></link> damage by $2. Remove all <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> stacks after this skill (can activate <link=\"s|197\"><u>[Laceration]</u></link> effects).": "",
  "Transform into <link=\"s|198\"><u>[Hunter]</u></link>, immediately inflict $1 <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> stacks on 1 foe; Then, immediately transform into <link=\"s|199\"><u>[Executioner]</u></link>, deal Phys damage equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK (can activate <link=\"s|197\"><u>[Laceration]</u></link> effects).": "",
  "Transform into [Hunter], immediately inflict $1 [Bleed] stacks on <color=#FFFF00>1</color> foe; Then, immediately transform into [Executioner], deal Phys damage equal to $2 of ATK (can activate [Laceration] effects).": "",
  "<link=\"s|198\"><u>[Hunter]</u></link>: Deal Phys damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK ($1 hits), then inflict $3 <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> stack.\\n<link=\"s|199\"><u>[Executioner]</u></link>: Deal Phys damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> of ATK, remove $4 <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> stacks after this skill (can activate <link=\"s|197\"><u>[Laceration]</u></link> effects).": "",
  "<link=\"s|198\"><u>[Hunter]</u></link>: Deal Phys damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK ($1 hits). Immediately deal <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> damage and refresh <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> duration.\\n<link=\"s|199\"><u>[Executioner]</u></link>: Deal Phys damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> of ATK, for every 1 <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> stack on the target, increase <link=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> and <link=\"s|197\"><u>[Laceration]</u></link> damage by $4. Remove all <link=\"s|196\"><u>[Bleed]</u></link> stacks after this skill (can activate <link=\"s|197\"><u>[Laceration]</u></link> effects).": "",
  "Take a certain amount of damage each turn": "",
  "Skill change": "",
  "<color=#FF0000>{{A}}</color> transformed into [Executioner]!": "",
  "B<color=#000000>l</color>eed": "",
  "L<color=#000000>a</color>ceration": "",
  "E<color=#000000>x</color>ecutioner": "",
  "r:\"<link\\=(.+?)><u>Doctor</u></link> mode: Deal Physical damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack \\((\\d+) hits\\) and inflict (\\d+) <link\\=(.+?)><u>Bleed</u></link> stack\\.  <link\\=(.+?)><u>Ripper</u></link> mode: Deal Physical damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack, then remove (\\d+) Bleed stacks from the target \\(can activate <link\\=(.+?)><u>Rending</u></link> effects\\)\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"<link\\=(.+?)><u>Doctor</u></link> mode: Deal Physical damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack \\((\\d+) hits\\)\\. At the same time, activate <link\\=(.+?)><u>Bleed</u></link> damage and reset the turn duration of the target's Bleed stacks (\\d+) time\\.\\n<link\\=(.+?)><u>Ripper</u></link> mode: Deal Physical damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack\\. For each Bleed stack on the target, increase the damage of <link\\=(.+?)><u>Rending</u></link> activated by them and this skill by (\\d+)%, then remove all Bleed stacks from the target \\(can activate Rending effects\\)\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Switch to <link\\=(.+?)><u>Ripper</u></link> mode and change Kitazato's skills \\(can be activated when any foe has (\\d+) or more <link\\=(.+?)><u>Bleed</u></link> stacks\\)\\.\\nWhen using skills in this mode, for every (\\d+) <link\\=(.+?)><u>Bleed</u></link> stacks on the target, inflict (\\d+) <link\\=(.+?)><u>Rending</u></link> stack \\(Physical damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack\\)\\.\\nAfter using this skill, Kitazato can use other skills and switches to <link\\=(.+?)><u>Doctor</u></link> mode at the end of the turn\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Highlight：Switch to <link\\=(.+?)><u>Doctor</u></link> mode and immediately inflict (\\d+) <link\\=(.+?)><u>Bleed</u></link> stacks on 1 foe\\.\\nThen, immediately switch to <link\\=(.+?)><u>Ripper</u></link> mode and deal Physical damage to the target equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack \\(can activate <link\\=(.+?)><u>Rending</u></link> effects\\)\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Physical damage to 1 foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：<link\\=(.+?)><u>Doctor</u></link>: Deal light Physical damage to 1 foe \\((\\d+) hits\\)\\.  <link\\=(.+?)><u>Ripper</u></link>: Deal Physical damage to 1 foe\\.\\nRanged Attack：Deal Gun damage to 1 foe\\. Can fire until out of ammo\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"For every (\\d+)% of Kitazato's ailment accuracy, increase Physical damage from <link\\=(.+?)><u>Bleed</u></link> by (\\d+)% of Attack \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of ailment accuracy\\)\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"When in <link\\=(.+?)><u>Doctor</u></link> mode, increase ailment accuracy by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\.\\nWhen in <link\\=(.+?)><u>Ripper</u></link> mode, increase pierce rate by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\.\"": "",
  "Kitazato has 2 modes, Doctor and Ripper, and the properties of his skills change depending on the mode. He starts in Doctor mode.\\nDoctor: Each time Kitazato deals damage with a skill, there is a 70% chance to inflict 1 Bleed stack on the target. When a foe with Bleed is defeated, its Bleed stacks are passed on to the foe with the highest HP. He can also spend SP to use Physical skills.\\nRipper: When Kitazato uses a skill, inflict 1 Rending stack for every 3 Bleed stacks on the target.\\nBleed: Each turn, deal Almighty damage equal to 1% of the target's max HP + Physical damage equal to 4% of Kitazato's Attack. This effect lasts for 4 turns and stacks up to 10 times.\\nRending: Deal Physical damage based on Kitazato's Attack and Nightfall's skill level (this damage cannot deal critical hits or Down Point damage).": "",
  "In <link\\=\"s|198\"><u>Doctor</u></link> mode, the first time skill damage is dealt to each foe, inflict 5 more <link\\=\"s|196\"><u>Bleed</u></link> stacks on the target.\\nIn <link\\=\"s|199\"><u>Ripper</u></link> mode, when using a skill on a foe, increase that skill's damage based on the number of debuffs on the target. When they are inflicted with 10 or more debuffs, maximize this effect and increase skill damage up to 80%. Also, multiply Bleed's Almighty damage by 1.5.": "",
  "r:\"(?s)Increase the Attack multiplier of <link\\=\\\"s\\|(\\d+)\\\"><u>Rending</u></link> by ([\\d%]+) of Kitazato's Attack\\..*?Restore Kitazato's HP by ([\\d%]+) of Rending damage dealt.*?(\\d+) \\+ (\\d+) each turn\\)\\.\"": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Crimson Operation / Pathology and Nightfall by 3.": "",
  "Highlight Enhanced: Increase Highlight damage by 8% for each <link\\=\"s|196\"><u>Bleed</u></link> stack inflicted on the target.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Moonlit Scalpel / Midnight Surgery and Thief Tactics by 3.": "",
  "Increase the maximum stacks of <link\\=\"s|196\"><u>Bleed</u></link> to 13. Also, each foe will always be inflicted with 3 stacks of Bleed.\\nWhen using Midnight Surgery in <link\\=\"s|199\"><u>Ripper</u></link> mode, do not remove the target's Bleed stacks. Also evolve <link\\=\"s|197\"><u>Rending</u></link> effects to Killing Frenzy, increase damage by 100%, and deal 50% damage to all other foes. Killing Frenzy can activate effects from Rending with all skills.": "",
  "r:\"^Switch\\\\s+Kitazato\\\\s+to\\\\s+Ripper\\\\s+mode\\\\s+and\\\\s+change\\\\s+other\\\\s+skills\\\\s+\\\\(can\\\\s+be\\\\s+activated\\\\s+when\\\\s+any\\\\s+foe\\\\s+has\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\+\\\\s+Bleed\\\\)\\\\.\\\\s+When\\\\s+using\\\\s+skills\\\\s+in\\\\s+this\\\\s+mode,\\\\s+inflict\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+more\\\\s+Rending\\\\s+for\\\\s+every\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+Bleed\\\\s+on\\\\s+target\\\\.\\\\s+Rending:\\\\s+Deal\\\\s+Phys\\\\s+dmg\\\\s+\\\\((\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\s+Atk\\\\)\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Phys\\\\s+dmg\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+foe\\\\s+\\\\((\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\s+Atk,\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+hits\\\\)\\\\.\\\\s+Also\\\\s+activate\\\\s+Bleed\\\\s+dmg\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+time\\\\s+and\\\\s+reset\\\\s+target's\\\\s+Bleed\\\\s+turn\\\\s+duration\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Switch\\\\s+to\\\\s+Doctor\\\\s+mode\\\\s+and\\\\s+inflict\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+Bleed\\\\s+on\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+foe\\\\.\\\\s+Immediately\\\\s+switch\\\\s+to\\\\s+Ripper\\\\s+mode\\\\s+and\\\\s+deal\\\\s+Phys\\\\s+dmg\\\\s+to\\\\s+target\\\\s+\\\\((\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\s+Atk,\\\\s+can\\\\s+activate\\\\s+Rending\\\\s+effects\\\\)\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Phys\\\\s+dmg\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+foe\\\\s+\\\\((\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\s+Atk,\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+hits\\\\)\\\\.\\\\s+Inflict\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+Bleed\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Phys\\\\s+dmg\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+foe\\\\s+\\\\((\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\s+Atk\\\\)\\\\s+and\\\\s+remove\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+Bleed\\\\s+\\\\(can\\\\s+activate\\\\s+Rending\\\\s+effects\\\\)\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Phys\\\\s+dmg\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+foe\\\\s+\\\\((\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\s+Atk\\\\)\\\\.\\\\s+Increase\\\\s+dmg\\\\s+from\\\\s+this\\\\s+skill\\\\s+and\\\\s+Rending\\\\s+(\\\\d+)%\\\\s+for\\\\s+every\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+Bleed\\\\s+stack\\\\s+on\\\\s+target\\\\.\\\\s+Then\\\\s+remove\\\\s+all\\\\s+Bleed\\\\s+from\\\\s+target\\\\s+\\\\(can\\\\s+activate\\\\s+Rending\\\\s+effects\\\\)\\\\.$\"": ""
